Museums describe what their objects are made of with shared terms, so that records from different collections agree and link to wider cultural-heritage data. This wiki keeps a controlled vocabulary of materials, each term matched to the [https://www.getty.edu/research/tools/vocabularies/aat/ Getty Art & Architecture Thesaurus] (AAT). Anyone editing an artwork picks its materials from this list, while only vocabulary editors can add, change or remove terms.

